#: content/docs/install.md:42
msgid "Known significant software issues"
msgstr ""

#: content/docs/install.md:43
msgid ""
"[Many apps exhibit papercuts](https://invent.kde.org/kde-linux/kde-linux/-/"
"issues/71) as a result of them being packaged as Flatpaks"
