msgid ""
"Ensure that Secure Boot is disabled. If it isn’t, or you don’t know whether "
"it is or not, enter the computer’s UEFI interface and disable it. Here’s how:"
msgstr ""

#: content/docs/install.md:62
msgid ""
"First, consult [the table here](https://forums.malwarebytes.com/topic/319165-"
"pc-common-boot-menu-and-bios-setting-hotkeys/) and find the correct keyboard "
